o di Alex si trasformerà in un terribile incubo per ognuno di loro, e che dovranno lottare duramente per sopravvivere."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Arthur: Malediction","overview":"Longtime Minimoys fan Alex is taken by his friends to the filming location for his 18th birthday, unaware that they're all in for a horrific time.","tagline":"When your childhood dream becomes your biggest nightmare!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Alex, 18 ans, est un fan de la série de films fantastiques Arthur depuis qu'il est enfant. Lorsque son groupe d'amis très soudé le surprend en l'invitant à se rendre dans la maison abandonnée où le film a été tourné, ils se dirigent involontairement vers un piège tordu et mortel. Ce qui était autrefois un rêve d'enfant va bientôt se transformer en un véritable cauchemar."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z8B2tSPUwP7BL4N6b9H611y6Khp.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/szX8DlIgwBnrmoziiq8u8nCCWSP.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":955569,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z8B2tSPUwP7BL4N6b9H611y6Khp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z8B2tSPUwP7BL4N6b9H611y6Khp.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z8B2tSPUwP7BL4N6b9H611y6Khp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z8B2tSPUwP7BL4N6b9H611y6Khp.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zdiKyGZ93svgQi0PsbJzRCFKagW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zdiKyGZ93svgQi0PsbJzRCFKagW.jpg","language":"it","width":761,"height":1000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2MVrHAbbMFXhFmLsVK1